<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain's Q4 M3 rises 7.8 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Bahrain's Q4 M3 rises 7.8 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain's broadly defined M3 money supply rose 7.8 percent in the fourth quarter of 1996 on the previous quarter, Bahrain Monetary Agency figure show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (percentage changes over three months)</p>
<p>	     Q4 1996     Q3 1996     Q2 1996     Q1 1996</p>
<p> M3	   +7.8	 -1.1	  +1.0	   -2.8</p>
<p> M2	   +2.2	 -0.3	  +1.1	   -0.2</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (in millions of dinars)</p>
<p>	     Q4 1996    Q3 1996     Q2 1996     Q1 1996</p>
<p> M3	  1,947.8    1,806.1     1,826.3     1,808.0</p>
<p> M2	  1,437.9    1,406.8     1,411.2     1,395.3</p>
<p>NOTE: No figures were given for M1</p>
</text>
